{"answer":{"id":"edbc8dfe7349","text":"The form used for standard discount approvals is the same as for other quote approvals—it is the quote itself submitted for approval directly in Salesforce. There is no separate or external form for standard discount approvals. All required information, including the \"Submitter Comments\" field, is completed within the Salesforce quote, and the approval process follows the Deal Approval Matrix. Approvals and communications are managed within Salesforce, often using Chatter.\n\nSources:\n- Sales Order Processing: How to Submit a Quote for Discount and Payment Term Approval [sales/field-operations/order-processing#how-to-submit-a-quote-for-discount-and-payment-term-approval]\n- Go-To-Market Technical Documentation: Quote Approval System [sales/field-operations/sales-systems/gtm-technical-documentation/_index#quote-approval-system]\n\nOwner: @jrabbits (Sales Order Processing), @kchinthapalli1 (GTM Technical Documentation)","status":"fresh","created":"2026-10-17T19:29:16","asked_at":"2026-10-16T19:52:00+02:00","stale_reason":null,"stale_since":null,"question":"Is that the same form as for the standard discount approvals, or a different one?"},"graph":{"nodes":[{"id":"A:edbc8dfe7349","type":"Answer","label":"Answer","hl":true,"status":"fresh","text":"The form used for standard discount approvals is the same as for other quote approvals—it is the quote itself submitted for approval directly in Salesforce. There is no separate or external form for standard discount approvals. All required information, including the \"Submitter Comments\" field, is completed within the Salesforce quote, and the approval process follows the Deal Approval Matrix. Approvals and communications are managed within Salesforce, often using Chatter.\n\nSources:\n- Sales Order Processing: How to Submit a Quote for Discount and Payment Term Approval [sales/field-operations/o","domains":["content/handbook/sales/field-operations/"]},{"id":"Q:f35a117dec","type":"Question","label":"Is that the same form as for the standard discount approvals, or a different one?","hl":true,"domains":["content/handbook/sales/field-operations/"]},{"id":"P:content/handbook/sales/field-operations/order-processing.md","type":"Page","label":"Sales Order Processing","hl":true,"path":"content/handbook/sales/field-operations/order-processing.md","url":"/handbook/sales/field-operations/order-processing/","source":"docs","kind":"live","owner_source":"explicit","domains":["content/handbook/sales/field-operations/"]},{"id":"S:content/handbook/sales/field-operations/order-processing.md#how-to-submit-a-quote-for-discount-and-payment-term-approval@d5b05527ec3f","type":"Section","label":"**How to Submit a Quote for Discount and Payment Term Approval**","hl":true,"cite":"sales/field-operations/order-processing#how-to-submit-a-quote-for-discount-and-payment-term-approval","since":"2026-04-01T20:57:16+02:00","until":null,"text":"The following is intended as a guide for Opportunity Owners who need to submit a quote for approval for discount or payment terms. If the quote requires approvals before sending to a customer, there will be a <span style=\"color:red\">**red stop sign**</span> flagged with \"**Additional Approvals Required**\".\n\n#### Standard Quote Approval\n\nPrior to generating a standard (non-draft) quote to deliver to a client or prospect in PDF format, any non-standard deal elements (discounts, unique payment terms, and other items found in the matrix) must be approved. The following steps outline the process for how to correctly submit a quote for approval. This approval flow follows the criteria in [our appr","current":true,"domains":["content/handbook/sales/field-operations/"]},{"id":"X:docs","type":"Source","label":"docs","hl":false,"kind":"live","domains":["content/handbook/sales/field-operations/"]},{"id":"O:@jrabbits","type":"Person","label":"@jrabbits","hl":true,"handle":"@jrabbits","domains":["content/handbook/sales/field-operations/"]},{"i